 * @title      Maple Syrup USDC Adapter
 * @author     Byzanlink (https://byzanlink.com)
 * @version    2.0.0
 * @custom:security security@byzanlink.com
 *
 * @notice
 * Adapter for routing Byzanlink Vault V2 liquidity into the Maple Finance
 * Syrup USDC pool. Mints syrupUSDC on deposit and manages the withdrawal
 * lifecycle through the Maple async redemption queue.
 *
 * Key capabilities:
 *  - USDC → syrupUSDC deposit via SyrupRouter (plain or EIP-712 authorise-and-deposit).
 *  - Async redemption lifecycle: requestRedeem → settle → deallocate back to vault.
 *  - Configurable reserve percentage kept idle for small synchronous withdrawals.
 *  - Partial/full cancellation of pending Maple redeem requests.
 *  - Operator-gated allocation with owner-controlled admin parameters.
